msgid "About Manual Entry"
msgstr "Tentang Pengisian Manual"

#: templates/admin/pos_app/wizard/step5_configure.html:92
msgid ""
"The manual entry provider is for standalone terminals that process cards "
"independently. After each terminal transaction, you'll enter the card "
"details (brand, last 4 digits) manually in the POS app."
msgstr ""
"Penyedia input manual digunakan untuk terminal mandiri yang memproses kartu "
"secara independen. Setelah setiap transaksi terminal, Anda akan memasukkan "
"detail kartu (merek, 4 digit terakhir) secara manual di aplikasi POS."

#: templates/admin/pos_app/wizard/step5_configure.html:101
msgid "Ready to Connect"
msgstr "Siap untuk Terhubung"

#: templates/admin/pos_app/wizard/step5_configure.html:102
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your %(name)s account is verified and ready. Click \"Save & Connect\" to "
"complete the setup."
msgstr ""
"Akun %(name)s Anda telah diverifikasi dan siap. Klik \"Simpan & Hubungkan\" "
"untuk menyelesaikan pengaturan."

